                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eead517d-e47a-3890-8d8a-61cdc4d06702",
                        "entry_id": "1e039a2d-4cd6-3980-b893-4be56bc051e2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "одержать верх; победить, преодолев сопротивление, помехи и т. п."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "над кем., над чем."
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c6bbe3c6-d350-49c4-aa07-3f632adfd4e2",
                        "source_entry_id": "1e039a2d-4cd6-3980-b893-4be56bc051e2",
                        "source_sense_id": "eead517d-e47a-3890-8d8a-61cdc4d06702",
                        "target_lang_word": "prevail",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "prevail",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ccce7ac0-7242-3d54-81e3-66c63eb85d07",
                                        "entry_id": "28209bf2-6d2f-352e-9d48-4cedbd39aae0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be superior in strength, dominance, influence, or frequency; to have or gain the advantage over others; to have the upper hand; to outnumber others."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffaf1f49-eb4c-4ae1-8978-6ae0e3164886",
                                                "sense_id": "ccce7ac0-7242-3d54-81e3-66c63eb85d07",
                                                "text": "Red colour prevails in the Canadian flag."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8746ca5-2f5e-49e9-8a31-ab4bf490ce7a",
                                                "sense_id": "ccce7ac0-7242-3d54-81e3-66c63eb85d07",
                                                "text": "And it came to pass, when Moses held up his hand, that Israel prevailed; and when he let down his hand, Amalek prevailed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c4fe7d4-18c4-43a7-926c-015d36d4cad9",
                                                "sense_id": "ccce7ac0-7242-3d54-81e3-66c63eb85d07",
                                                "text": "Liverpool created a host of chances and had a Joel Matip goal ruled out for a foul and offside in an incident-packed game that went right down to the wire before Jurgen Klopp's side prevailed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f8abdfc7-293b-3d63-94bb-c2938c666356",
                                        "entry_id": "28209bf2-6d2f-352e-9d48-4cedbd39aae0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To triumph; to be victorious."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70b77517-929b-4908-a604-217af8956617",
                                                "sense_id": "f8abdfc7-293b-3d63-94bb-c2938c666356",
                                                "text": "There are a number of SCPs and tales that look at potential apocalypses, but rarely with such totality as SCP-2935, a parallel dimension in which death prevailed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75fb0b73-2cde-4b5f-b47f-cea6e75ea6c1",
                                                "sense_id": "f8abdfc7-293b-3d63-94bb-c2938c666356",
                                                "text": "Zakharova also made light of Moore’s claims that Russia will not be able to regain momentum in the war after the MI6 chief said he was”optimistic”^([sic]) Ukraine would prevail against the Russian invasion."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "64679317-5bdd-347b-a80a-d3996359b68d",
                                        "entry_id": "28209bf2-6d2f-352e-9d48-4cedbd39aae0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be current, widespread, or predominant; to have currency or prevalence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84ef68e3-6df2-4337-82ed-fd088945b02d",
                                                "sense_id": "64679317-5bdd-347b-a80a-d3996359b68d",
                                                "text": "In his day and age, such practices prevailed all over Europe."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8bf3d096-fbbb-38d7-b5e7-00ec390d5f8f",
                                        "entry_id": "28209bf2-6d2f-352e-9d48-4cedbd39aae0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To succeed in persuading or inducing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cfe22d54-b95d-423c-ab90-2326336e1192",
                                                "sense_id": "8bf3d096-fbbb-38d7-b5e7-00ec390d5f8f",
                                                "text": "I prevailed on him to wait."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c902359-da65-42d1-a76b-585ad5e4f792",
                                                "sense_id": "8bf3d096-fbbb-38d7-b5e7-00ec390d5f8f",
                                                "text": "Jones began to be very importunate with the lady to unmask; and at length having prevailed, there appeared not Mrs Fitzpatrick, but the Lady Bellaston herself."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5307b09c-1e08-3939-917c-fca7aeb776b3",
                                        "entry_id": "28209bf2-6d2f-352e-9d48-4cedbd39aae0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To avail."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "acda0d4d-3254-4d4c-b789-a04145de1c5d",
                        "source_entry_id": "1e039a2d-4cd6-3980-b893-4be56bc051e2",
                        "source_sense_id": "eead517d-e47a-3890-8d8a-61cdc4d06702",
                        "target_lang_word": "triompher",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "triompher",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f8e2a59d-aed5-3b22-90c8-b4464914f36d",
                                        "entry_id": "67f8b823-d6a8-313f-95c3-352a2242af0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Faire une entrée pompeuse et solennelle dans Rome après quelque insigne victoire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ancient-Roman"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2e25dc4-2a77-4d2e-bb4d-296628051ce5",
                                                "sense_id": "f8e2a59d-aed5-3b22-90c8-b4464914f36d",
                                                "text": "Pompée triompha trois fois."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2ba68f8c-66f1-3454-834f-fb635c6ec5c2",
                                        "entry_id": "67f8b823-d6a8-313f-95c3-352a2242af0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Remporter une victoire éclatante."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "common"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4622f48-3318-4c45-ab94-d92ae40ee307",
                                                "sense_id": "2ba68f8c-66f1-3454-834f-fb635c6ec5c2",
                                                "text": "Chemin faisant l'émeute triomphait sans combattre. On désarmait les troupes qui se laissaient faire, et on protégeait leur retraite."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5be1d8f5-137c-4495-b163-aadb676d5c12",
                                                "sense_id": "2ba68f8c-66f1-3454-834f-fb635c6ec5c2",
                                                "text": "Les travaux imposés à Hercule tendent soit à le faire échouer, auxquels cas il meurt, et il n'est plus un dieu (puisque n'étant pas immortel et invincible) soit à le faire triompher, auxquels cas il est un véritable dieu et rejoint l’Olympe."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "842d5ac8-4f70-3ab4-b795-7e9eb7f639d7",
                                        "entry_id": "67f8b823-d6a8-313f-95c3-352a2242af0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Remporter quelque avantage que ce soit sur quelqu’un."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1bf23b0f-0c49-40c3-a6ac-140fa634f234",
                                                "sense_id": "842d5ac8-4f70-3ab4-b795-7e9eb7f639d7",
                                                "text": "Drumont comptait sans doute sur la victoire du boulangisme pour faire triompher sa doctrine et imposer aux juifs une législation moyenâgeuse ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc91ed66-1350-4513-8d00-f2c0791a32dd",
                                                "sense_id": "842d5ac8-4f70-3ab4-b795-7e9eb7f639d7",
                                                "text": "Triompher de ses adversaires, de ses envieux, de ses rivaux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb3e84db-90ed-49d7-9ea0-ecd9b63c1c76",
                                                "sense_id": "842d5ac8-4f70-3ab4-b795-7e9eb7f639d7",
                                                "text": "L’innocence a triomphé."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eae0befa-b85f-4701-b6d5-27194e88110f",
                                                "sense_id": "842d5ac8-4f70-3ab4-b795-7e9eb7f639d7",
                                                "text": "Cet avocat a fait triompher le bon droit."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c47ccc62-f78f-37c9-948c-3398c1a7fe71",
                                        "entry_id": "67f8b823-d6a8-313f-95c3-352a2242af0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vaincre, subjuguer, surmonter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a352a072-71f6-4402-8e0d-3b251019d38e",
                                                "sense_id": "c47ccc62-f78f-37c9-948c-3398c1a7fe71",
                                                "text": "Il pressentait que l'eau triompherait des semelles sans résistance, et, sournoisement, s'infiltrerait jusqu'aux chevilles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb886290-0b7c-4297-b373-521e2d513532",
                                                "sense_id": "c47ccc62-f78f-37c9-948c-3398c1a7fe71",
                                                "text": "Triompher de ses passions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90f33a75-74a0-4f5b-ac7c-07ba6283dfa5",
                                                "sense_id": "c47ccc62-f78f-37c9-948c-3398c1a7fe71",
                                                "text": "Sa sagesse a triomphé de tous les dangers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e53c50e9-3fc6-4ef0-852f-badfedcb9cd3",
                                                "sense_id": "c47ccc62-f78f-37c9-948c-3398c1a7fe71",
                                                "text": "à la longue, la vérité triomphe de l’erreur."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bd7d46cd-a483-3370-90a3-7e3034672100",
                                        "entry_id": "67f8b823-d6a8-313f-95c3-352a2242af0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exceller en traitant quelque sujet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f4a34b9-378b-48ad-9d48-8c264c22beef",
                                                "sense_id": "bd7d46cd-a483-3370-90a3-7e3034672100",
                                                "text": "Quand il est sur cette matière, il triomphe."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c11da26a-ed72-3716-8e4e-26117e687182",
                                        "entry_id": "67f8b823-d6a8-313f-95c3-352a2242af0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Se prévaloir, tirer avantage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e21ba551-0f03-4a4b-8984-8d15fcbb1997",
                                                "sense_id": "c11da26a-ed72-3716-8e4e-26117e687182",
                                                "text": "Ses ennemis triomphèrent de ses aveux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db7f08b5-f78a-4432-9852-9920ed012048",
                                                "sense_id": "c11da26a-ed72-3716-8e4e-26117e687182",
                                                "text": "Il y a dans les écrits de ce théologien plusieurs passages dont les ennemis de la religion ont triomphé."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4daff0c3-e3e8-3d7b-a82e-93a89fbd9d52",
                                        "entry_id": "67f8b823-d6a8-313f-95c3-352a2242af0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tirer vanité de quelque chose."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41b7e879-7cdb-4e76-9e59-d4daf4462590",
                                                "sense_id": "4daff0c3-e3e8-3d7b-a82e-93a89fbd9d52",
                                                "text": "Il triomphe de sa perfidie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b2d64b2-9f2f-4761-a06c-a4a8bc2ba269",
                                                "sense_id": "4daff0c3-e3e8-3d7b-a82e-93a89fbd9d52",
                                                "text": "Il a obtenu ce qu’il prétendait, il en triomphe."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c961e6e2-7465-33b1-aa9e-9ed2e8abcb49",
                                        "entry_id": "67f8b823-d6a8-313f-95c3-352a2242af0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Être ravi de joie, de fierté."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a63218b-ed6d-4452-bfc1-710069c6b3e3",
                                                "sense_id": "c961e6e2-7465-33b1-aa9e-9ed2e8abcb49",
                                                "text": "Quand on lui parle de ses enfants, elle triomphe."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5b8a082b-ef36-4598-bef7-898fcf7833fd",
                        "source_entry_id": "1e039a2d-4cd6-3980-b893-4be56bc051e2",
                        "source_sense_id": "eead517d-e47a-3890-8d8a-61cdc4d06702",
                        "target_lang_word": "prévaloir",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "prévaloir",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a3615a37-615d-30be-a1ed-701f21a503ca",
                                        "entry_id": "b1f97861-735d-3d58-84ae-caba23e5de77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Avoir l’avantage, remporter l’avantage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a6bd34e-32b9-4fdb-ae54-d68c44daccb8",
                                                "sense_id": "a3615a37-615d-30be-a1ed-701f21a503ca",
                                                "text": "Son adversaire a prévalu."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60e6165a-d1dc-446e-8a5d-0ed9acf186f1",
                                                "sense_id": "a3615a37-615d-30be-a1ed-701f21a503ca",
                                                "text": "Il ne faut pas que la coutume prévale sur la raison, contre la raison."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60ce280a-246f-4763-a334-aed591b0e64a",
                                                "sense_id": "a3615a37-615d-30be-a1ed-701f21a503ca",
                                                "text": "La faveur prévaut souvent sur le mérite."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba89bb12-7fe5-4b72-ac3a-4b6cc56b878b",
                                                "sense_id": "a3615a37-615d-30be-a1ed-701f21a503ca",
                                                "text": "Cette considération a prévalu sur toutes les autres."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46236297-ffa9-3f57-a2cc-5858f121e861",
                                        "entry_id": "b1f97861-735d-3d58-84ae-caba23e5de77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Avoir plus d'importance ; dominer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f048a86e-554a-4a21-ac01-0555df5f2420",
                                                "sense_id": "46236297-ffa9-3f57-a2cc-5858f121e861",
                                                "text": "Dans les assemblées souveraines, la médiocrité prévaut fatalement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb5788c0-f084-4bb4-b855-97bcaeabe187",
                                                "sense_id": "46236297-ffa9-3f57-a2cc-5858f121e861",
                                                "text": "Mais la dureté de l’homme que je suis, le dénûment affreux de son cœur, ce don qu’il détient d’inspirer la haine et de créer autour de soi le désert, rien de tout cela ne prévaut contre l’espérance…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a45eed91-01a4-490a-88a9-1bd74d547bdb",
                                                "sense_id": "46236297-ffa9-3f57-a2cc-5858f121e861",
                                                "text": "Il semble que les principes gérontocratiques et kakistocratiques, qui nous caractérisent, ont prévalu sur les principes démocratiques et républicains."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b122de7-61b5-484d-a4d8-d1bebd2eb73a",
                                                "sense_id": "46236297-ffa9-3f57-a2cc-5858f121e861",
                                                "text": "Dès à présent, toutes les mesures nécessaires pour protéger la santé des populations celle des personnels de la santé et des soignant·e·s parmi lesquels une grande majorité de femmes, doivent être mises en œuvre, et ceci doit largement prévaloir sur les considérations économiques."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
